ed States has increased steadily during the last three decades\"}]}, {\"v\": \"evaluation or monitoring\", \"ev\": [{\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"A national health objective for 2010 is to increase to 70%\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"to monitor the progress in cancer survivorship\"}]}], \"methods_quotes\": [{\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"estimates were adjusted to obtain lifetime or complete counts by using a statistical model\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"taking into account loss to follow-up\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"statistical modeling of incidence and survival, controlling for age and sex\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"validated by using 1940--1997 data from the historical Connecticut registry\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"data for all races combined were estimated by summing the counts for whites/unknown, blacks, and other races\"}]}, \"confidence\": \"medium\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"study_design\", \"analytic_depth\"]}", "type": "text"}]}